    "Condition : 1 - Reason for refusal\r\n\r\nThe proposed roof extension, by means of its unconventional design and the presence of the existing dormer extensions, would dominate the rear roof plane and would be a visually incongruous feature.  It would further harm the appearance of the house, which has already been extensively modified and is considered contrary with policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Housing Extensions) of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003 and the Council's Residential Extensions Guidelines.\r\n"
